      "chunk_type": "text",
      "text": "Selecting the location for your speakers\nFor best results, mount both speakers on the same wall, facing the listening area. Make sure they do not face each other. (Outdoors, if you are not using an existing wall, consider the length of your listening area as your “wall.”)",
